    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beloved Playdate platformer is now available on Steam!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summit : Steps of Solace\u00a0</strong>is an exhilarating mountain climbing precision platformer, where you scale a relentless peak filled with brutal jumps, hazards, and shifting terrain. Master a range of tools to ascend higher, where every fall is a lesson and each hard-earned step gets you closer to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average story playthrough is about <strong>1-1.5 hours</strong> in length.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/6e6c76659de238ad2b7208129406ce81.poster.avif?t=1750352590\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/6e6c76659de238ad2b7208129406ce81.webm?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/6e6c76659de238ad2b7208129406ce81.mp4?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with 2 pickaxes, scale the mountain to reach the top. Avoid physics based environmental hazards as you uncover the story behind our protagonist\u2019s unwavering tenacity to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/26bc670c0fb66ded5c1b9f9a618c5954.poster.avif?t=1750352590\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/26bc670c0fb66ded5c1b9f9a618c5954.webm?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/26bc670c0fb66ded5c1b9f9a618c5954.mp4?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed run mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collectibles\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will <strong>you</strong> reach the summit?</p>",
